@startuml bridge_independent_evolution
title Niezalezny rozwoj abstrakcji i implementacji

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam noteFontSize 11

|Team A - Piloty (Abstraction)|
|Team B - Urzadzenia (Implementor)|

|Team A - Piloty (Abstraction)|
:Sprint 1;
note right
  BasicRemote
  AdvancedRemote
end note

|Team B - Urzadzenia (Implementor)|
:Sprint 1;
note left
  TvDevice
  RadioDevice
end note

|Team A - Piloty (Abstraction)|
:Sprint 2\n+VoiceRemote;
note right
  Brak zmian w TvDevice/RadioDevice.
  VoiceRemote dostaje IDevice z konstruktora.
end note

|Team B - Urzadzenia (Implementor)|
:Sprint 2\n+ProjectorDevice;
note left
  Brak zmian w BasicRemote/AdvancedRemote.
  ProjectorDevice implementuje IDevice.
end note

|Team A - Piloty (Abstraction)|
:Sprint 3\n+GestureRemote;

|Team B - Urzadzenia (Implementor)|
:Sprint 3\n+SmartSpeakerDevice;

|Team A - Piloty (Abstraction)|
stop

@enduml
